sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Person as User
  participant Mic as Mic / Apple Audio
  participant Policy as Swift Turn Policy
  participant Audio as Playback Engine
  participant Provider as Voice Provider
  participant Core as Sovereign Core
  Person->>Mic: Speak or think aloud
  Mic->>Policy: confirmed speech started (not noise)
  opt Assistant audio is playing and user barge-in enabled
    Policy->>Audio: STOP audible playback now
    Policy->>Provider: Cancel spoken response if not auto cancelled
    opt WebSocket audio mode
      Policy->>Provider: Truncate at actually played milliseconds
    end
  end
  Mic->>Policy: Speech stopped / semantic turn complete?
  alt Incomplete thought or hold-to-finish mode
    Policy-->>Person: Keep listening / wait for explicit finish
  else Semantic end or manual finish
    Mic->>Policy: Final verified transcript
    Policy->>Core: Persist utterance with idempotency id
    Core-->>Policy: Durable checkpoint acknowledged
    opt Chained text-agent pathway
      Policy->>Core: Submit exactly once
    end
  end
  Note over Policy,Core: Stopping speech NEVER silently cancels backend tasks
  Core-->>Person: Task receipt / approval card (visual confirmation)
